[
{ type: install
  message: <<EOM
MiroTalk SFU has been installed under %%WWWDIR%% using the STANDARD build.

Enable it in /etc/rc.conf or /etc/rc.conf.local:

    mirotalk_enable="YES"

Configure MiroTalk using %%WWWDIR%%/.env and
%%WWWDIR%%/app/src/config.js.  See mirotalk(8).
Set JWT_SECRET to a strong random value of at least 32 characters in .env
(for example, openssl rand -hex 32). Missing or published default secrets
prevent startup. Configure your own accounts; published default credential
pairs are rejected when host protection or user authentication is enabled.

To use the customizable and privacy-hardened FreeBSD build instead, select
the HARDENED build option and rebuild/reinstall the port.
EOM
}
]
